    {
      "key": "batch",
      "name": "Photo Enhancement Suite",
      "description": "Batch-enhance a list of photos through a fixed retouch chain — auto-contrast, color, sharpening, and an AI cinematic-grade pass — with no folder path required, just drop images in.",
      "sourceId": "nodetool-base/Photo Enhancement Suite",
      "graph": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "comment-intro",
            "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
            "data": {
              "comment": "# 📷 Photo Enhancement Suite\n\nBatch-enhances a list of photos through a fixed retouch chain with an AI polish at the end. Drop images into the input, with no folder path required.\n\n**How it works:** \"1️⃣ Iterate photos\" sends each image from \"Photos to enhance\" down the chain. \"2️⃣ Auto-contrast\" clips 2% at each end. \"3️⃣ Brightness/Contrast\" raises contrast by a factor of 1.1. \"4️⃣ Adjust color\" multiplies brightness by \"Brightness factor\" (1.05) and saturation by \"Color factor\" (1.2). \"5️⃣ Sharpen\" and \"6️⃣ Sharpen detail\" apply two unsharp-mask passes at amounts 1 and 1.2. \"7️⃣ AI enhance\" runs FLUX Schnell image-to-image at strength 0.3 with a cinematic-grade prompt. \"8️⃣ Collect enhanced batch\" gathers the results into one list. Every step runs locally except \"7️⃣ AI enhance\", which needs a FAL key.\n\n**Try this:** Raise \"Color factor\" to 1.6 and compare the saturation of the output with the original."
            },
            "ui_properties": {
              "selected": false,
              "position": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 0
